{"id":"6f58babd1e46f709","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-representation.md","title":"Representation","display":"df-representation — Representation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-representation","aliases":["58-df-representation","Representation"],"display":"df-representation — Representation","depends_on":["[[58-df-algebra]]","[[58-df-linear-map]]","[[58-df-vector-space]]","[[58-df-field]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-representation</span><span>Representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-representation — Representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"58-df-algebra\">58-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"58-df-field\">58-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,A,V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V,\\rho\\in V\">\\(k,A,V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V,\\rho\\in V\\)</span> (all field, algebra, module, and action data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_S\\)</span> (algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"573b416d39297a97\" href=\"?note=573b416d39297a97\" title=\"58-df-algebra\">58-df-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k\\)</span> (vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (exact predicates from the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgebraRepStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgebraRepStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgebraRep}_{S,k}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgebraRep}_{S,k}\\)</span> (explicit representation predicate and compatibility projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representation\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgebraRepStructure}_S(\\rho,A,V,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_S(k,A,+_A,\\cdot_A)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\&amp;\\land0_A,1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(0_A+_Aa=a=a+_A0_A\\land1_A\\cdot_Aa=a=a\\cdot_A1_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,V^V)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho(a),V,V)\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda,\\mu\\in k\\;\\rho(a)(\\lambda\\odot_Vx+_V\\mu\\odot_Vy)=\\lambda\\odot_V\\rho(a)(x)+_V\\mu\\odot_V\\rho(a)(y)\\Bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\rho(a+_Ab)(x)=\\rho(a)(x)+_V\\rho(b)(x)\\land\\rho(a\\cdot_Ab)(x)=\\rho(a)(\\rho(b)(x))\\bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in k\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\\rho(\\lambda\\odot_Aa)(x)=\\lambda\\odot_V\\rho(a)(x)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\rho(1_A)(x)=x\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representation\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgebraRepStructure}_S(\\rho,A,V,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_S(k,A,+_A,\\cdot_A)\\\\&amp;\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\&amp;\\land0_A,1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(0_A+_Aa=a=a+_A0_A\\land1_A\\cdot_Aa=a=a\\cdot_A1_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,V^V)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho(a),V,V)\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda,\\mu\\in k\\;\\rho(a)(\\lambda\\odot_Vx+_V\\mu\\odot_Vy)=\\lambda\\odot_V\\rho(a)(x)+_V\\mu\\odot_V\\rho(a)(y)\\Bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\rho(a+_Ab)(x)=\\rho(a)(x)+_V\\rho(b)(x)\\land\\rho(a\\cdot_Ab)(x)=\\rho(a)(\\rho(b)(x))\\bigr)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in k\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\\rho(\\lambda\\odot_Aa)(x)=\\lambda\\odot_V\\rho(a)(x)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\rho(1_A)(x)=x\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representation\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgebraRep}_{S,k}(\\rho,A,V)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AlgebraRepStructure}_S(\\rho,A,V,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representation\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgebraRep}_{S,k}(\\rho,A,V)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AlgebraRepStructure}_S(\\rho,A,V,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The symbol is named <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgebraRep}_{S,k}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgebraRep}_{S,k}\\)</span> to avoid collision with the unrelated binary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_S\\)</span> used for categorical representatives.</li>\n<li>The explicit predicate checks the common field structure, both vector-space structures, pointwise linearity of every operator, and linear, unital, multiplicative dependence on the algebra element.</li>\n<li>Irreducibility, Schur's lemma, and complete reducibility are downstream notions and results.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fulton and Harris, Representation Theory</li>\n<li>Serre, Linear Representations of Finite Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"573b416d39297a97","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_S$ (algebra predicate, see [[58-df-algebra]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k$ (vector-space predicate, see [[58-df-vector-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,A,V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V,\\rho\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgebraRepStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgebraRep}_{S,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representation\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgebraRepStructure}_S(\\rho,A,V,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V)\\leftrightarrow\\left[\\begin{aligned}&\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_S(k,A,+_A,\\cdot_A)\\\\&\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,k,+_A,\\odot_A,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,k,+_V,\\odot_V,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\\\&\\land0_A,1_A\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(0_A+_Aa=a=a+_A0_A\\land1_A\\cdot_Aa=a=a\\cdot_A1_A)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,A,V^V)\\\\&\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho(a),V,V)\\land\\forall x,y\\in V\\;\\forall\\lambda,\\mu\\in k\\;\\rho(a)(\\lambda\\odot_Vx+_V\\mu\\odot_Vy)=\\lambda\\odot_V\\rho(a)(x)+_V\\mu\\odot_V\\rho(a)(y)\\Bigr)\\\\&\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\rho(a+_Ab)(x)=\\rho(a)(x)+_V\\rho(b)(x)\\land\\rho(a\\cdot_Ab)(x)=\\rho(a)(\\rho(b)(x))\\bigr)\\\\&\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in k\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall x\\in V\\;\\rho(\\lambda\\odot_Aa)(x)=\\lambda\\odot_V\\rho(a)(x)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\rho(1_A)(x)=x\\end{aligned}\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representation\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlgebraRep}_{S,k}(\\rho,A,V)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V\\in V\\;\\mathrm{AlgebraRepStructure}_S(\\rho,A,V,k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,\\odot_A,+_V,\\odot_V)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgebraRep}_{S,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rep}_S","display":false}],"bytes":2830,"backlinks":[{"id":"81fa5faf3598651a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Representation}_S$ (representation predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-representation.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1082","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-representation.md|58-df-representation]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["573b416d39297a97","f67456d74b418241","592f9cfb66a507c2","1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751"]}